#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid "Annotations"
msgstr "标注"

#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid ""
"Point, region, line and text annotations with reusable classes, cell "
"counting, HPF fields and measurements; GeoJSON (QuPath) import and export, "
"ASAP and Aperio ImageScope XML import."
msgstr ""
"点、区域、线和文字标注，支持可复用的类别、细胞计数、高倍视野和测量；支持 "
"GeoJSON（QuPath）导入和导出，以及 ASAP 和 Aperio ImageScope XML 导入。"

